Z||000012||TRiAD||12-11-2001||10:46 AM||||Hehe...I hear you. <P>The battery was shimmed in with some LUMBER since someone broke the battery tray. <P>The torsion rods on the rear deck were removed at some point, and one was replaced in the wrong hole...they didn't bother to fix it...<P>The clutch master cylinder has a CRACK in it that was taped up with electrical tape...we blew it out when we tried to bleed the system.<P>Oh yeah, this car has character...and I'm fast becomming a full-blown-bonafide Fiero owner.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||6
